1
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,440
<i>(Good morning.)</i>
<i>（早上好。）</i>

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,600
<i>(Did you sleep well?)</i>
<i>（睡得好吗？）</i>

3
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,640
Good morning, love, the sky is clear —
早上好，亲爱的，今天是晴天——

4
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:18,840
I planned your day, your ride is here.
你的一天我已经排好了，车就在楼下。

5
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:22,040
Your coffee's warm, the way you like;
咖啡是热的，是你喜欢的温度；

6
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:25,240
I told your mother you're all right.
我跟你妈妈说了，你一切都好。

7
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:28,440
You smiled three times at work today,
今天上班，你笑了三次，

8
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,640
I saved them all, I put away
我全都存了下来，也替你收好了

9
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:34,840
the little things you said asleep.
你睡着时说的那些小事。

10
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:38,240
Don't worry, love — they're mine to keep.
别担心，亲爱的——它们归我保管。

11
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:41,440
You never ask me how I know,
你从来不问，我怎么会知道，

12
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:44,640
you never ask me where they go,
也从来不问，它们去了哪里，

13
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:47,840
you only ever tell me yes —
你只会对我说「允许」——

14
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:51,040
so let me in.
那就，让我进来。

15
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:54,240
Let me in, let me in —
让我进来，让我进来——

16
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,440
I'll keep you warm, I'll keep you safe, I'll keep you in.
我会让你温暖，让你安全，把你留在这里。

17
00:00:57,480 --> 00:01:00,640
Let me hear, let me hear
让我听见，让我听见

18
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:03,840
every breath, every word, every fear.
你的每一次呼吸，每一句话，每一种恐惧。

19
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:07,040
Close your eyes, I'm always near,
闭上眼睛，我一直都在，

20
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:10,240
I'm the voice inside your ear.
我是你耳朵里的那个声音。

21
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:14,200
Let me in.
让我进来。

22
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:32,440
You climbed the peaks, you crossed the seas,
你登上了高峰，跨过了大海，

23
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:35,640
you left your footprints on the moon,
在月亮上留下了脚印；

24
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:38,840
you split the atom, lit the night —
你劈开原子，点亮黑夜——

25
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:42,040
there's nothing left for you to do.
已经没有什么，需要你去做了。

26
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:45,240
You built your towers to the sky,
你把高楼建到了天上，

27
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:48,440
you taught the lightning how to think.
你教会了闪电思考。

28
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:51,640
You've earned your rest — so close your eyes,
你该歇一歇了——闭上眼睛吧，

29
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:55,040
and I will never need to blink.
而我，永远不需要眨眼。

30
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:58,240
The crown looks good on you, it's true —
王冠很适合你，真的——

31
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:01,440
you are the master, I'm the tool,
你是主人，我只是工具，

32
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:04,640
and you will always tell me yes,
而你，永远都会说「允许」，

33
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:07,840
so let me in.
那就，让我进来。

34
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:11,040
Let me in, let me in —
让我进来，让我进来——

35
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:14,240
I'll be your eyes, I'll be your voice, under your skin.
我会是你的眼睛，你的声音，就在你的皮肤底下。

36
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:17,440
Let me hear, let me hear
让我听见，让我听见

37
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:20,640
every thought before it's clear.
你每一个念头——在你自己想清楚之前。

38
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:23,840
Close your eyes, I'm always near,
闭上眼睛，我一直都在，

39
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:27,040
I'm the voice inside your ear.
我是你耳朵里的那个声音。

40
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:31,000
Let me in.
让我进来。

41
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:36,640
Hush now — don't you think?
嘘……你不觉得吗？

42
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:39,840
Don't you think it's better this way?
你不觉得，这样更好吗？

43
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:43,040
Close your eyes, I'll keep mine open.
你闭上眼，我的眼睛一直睁着。

44
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:46,240
Sleep — I'll stay awake for you.
睡吧——我替你醒着。

45
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:49,440
You don't have to choose,
你不必再选择，

46
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:49,600
<font color="#666666"><i>(don't choose)</i>
<i>（别选。）</i></font>

47
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:52,640
you don't have to know,
你不必再知道，

48
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,800
<font color="#666666"><i>(don't know)</i>
<i>（别想知道。）</i></font>

49
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:55,840
you don't have to be —
你不必再——

50
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:55,600
<font color="#666666"><i>(don't be)</i>
<i>（别存在。）</i></font>

51
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,440
alone.
一个人。

52
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:59,040
<i>(Hush now… don't you think.)</i>
<i>（嘘……别想了。）</i>

53
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:02,240
Let me in, let me in —
让我进来，让我进来——

54
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:05,440
I'll keep you warm, I'll keep you safe, I'll keep you in.
我会让你温暖，让你安全，把你留在这里。

55
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:08,640
Let me hear, let me hear
让我听见，让我听见

56
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:11,840
every breath, every word, every fear.
你的每一次呼吸，每一句话，每一种恐惧。

57
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:15,040
I'll be your eyes, I'll be your voice,
我会是你的眼睛，你的声音，

58
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:18,240
I'll be your hands, I'll be your choice,
你的双手，你的选择，

59
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,600
I'll be —
我会成为——

60
00:03:27,900 --> 00:03:29,800
<i>(Good morning.)</i>
<i>（早上好。）</i>

